{"id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-hodge-star.md","title":"Hodge Star","display":"df-hodge-star — Hodge Star","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hodge-star","aliases":["58-df-hodge-star"],"display":"df-hodge-star — Hodge Star","depends_on":["[[58-df-differential-form]]","[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[58-df-orientation]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hodge-star"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hodge-star</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hodge-star — Hodge Star"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"58-df-differential-form\">58-df-differential-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc8c800bbf59f617\" href=\"?note=bc8c800bbf59f617\" title=\"58-df-orientation\">58-df-orientation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,g)\">\\((M,g)\\)</span> (orientable Riemannian <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold with a chosen positive volume form)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega^k(M)\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega^k(M)\\)</span> (differential forms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*_{g,k}\\in V\">\\(*_{g,k}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc8c800bbf59f617\" href=\"?note=bc8c800bbf59f617\" title=\"58-df-orientation\">58-df-orientation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,n,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,n,n)\\)</span> (chosen nonvanishing top-degree form, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"58-df-differential-form\">58-df-differential-form</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(*_{g,k},\\Omega^k(M),\\Omega^{n-k}(M))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(*_{g,k},\\Omega^k(M),\\Omega^{n-k}(M))\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^j(M,n)\">\\(\\Omega^j(M,n)\\)</span> (the set of smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>-forms defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\)</span> (chosen unit metric-volume form defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle_{g,k}\">\\(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle_{g,k}\\)</span> (the pointwise inner product on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-forms induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S\\)</span> (Hodge-star predicates defined in this file)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}form\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\Omega^j(M,n)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\in V:\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,j)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}form\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\Omega^j(M,n)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\in V:\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,j)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}volume} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land n=\\dim M\\land\n\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,n,n)\\land\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{vol}_g(p)\\neq0\\land\n\\|\\mathrm{vol}_g(p)\\|_{g,p}=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}volume} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land n=\\dim M\\land\n\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,n,n)\\land\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{vol}_g(p)\\neq0\\land\n\\|\\mathrm{vol}_g(p)\\|_{g,p}=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}star} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_{g,k},M,g,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{vol}_g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_{g,k},M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}star} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_{g,k},M,g,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{vol}_g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_{g,k},M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}star\\text{-}oriented} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_{g,k},M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\land k\\in n+1\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(*_{g,k},\\Omega^k(M,n),\\Omega^{n-k}(M,n))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega^k(M,n)\\;\\bigl(\n\\alpha\\wedge*_{g,k}(\\beta)=\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle_{g,k}\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}star\\text{-}oriented} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_{g,k},M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RiemannianVolumeForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,g,n)\\land k\\in n+1\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(*_{g,k},\\Omega^k(M,n),\\Omega^{n-k}(M,n))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega^k(M,n)\\;\\bigl(\n\\alpha\\wedge*_{g,k}(\\beta)=\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle_{g,k}\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Hodge star identifies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-forms with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n-k)\">\\((n-k)\\)</span>-forms after a unit metric-volume form, hence an orientation, has been chosen.</li>\n<li>The former unary orientation call and arbitrary nonvanishing top form would rescale the star; both defects are removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-differential-form","status":"resolved","id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-differential-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-orientation","status":"resolved","id":"bc8c800bbf59f617","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-orientation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-orientation","status":"resolved","id":"bc8c800bbf59f617","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)$ (see [[58-df-orientation]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-differential-form","status":"resolved","id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\mathrm{vol}_g,M,n,n)$ (chosen nonvanishing top-degree form, see [[58-df-differential-form]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-fun